Package: pubready
Title: Publication-Ready Figures with Statistics, R Engine
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Guesdon", email = "wguesdon@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The R engine for pubready. A curated library of parameterized recipe
    functions turns tidy data into a publication-ready figure with the chosen
    statistical test drawn on top, and writes a self-contained reproducibility
    bundle. Driven by the figkit CLI inside a pinned container; not intended for
    standalone install. The Python engine mirrors this package one to one.
